## Validation metrics & success criteria

- **Field-level reconstruction**: cross-correlation coefficient r(k) between true and reconstructed initial fields (goal: high r at scales targeted).
- **Power-spectrum recovery**: fractional error in P(k) across wavenumbers in range of interest.
- **Posterior coverage**: rank histograms / PIT tests showing calibrated uncertainties.
- **Runtime / resource**: realistic runtime and memory metrics for each stage; ability to run toy end-to-end on a single GPU.
- **Reproducibility**: notebook runs and reproduces published figures.

